# SHIN CORE LINX
# DELL Reality Acquisition Runtime

---

## Purpose

This directory implements the DELL-specific
Reality Acquisition Runtime.

The purpose of this Runtime is:

    PCProduct
        ↓
    Official URL
        ↓
    HTML Acquisition
        ↓
    Observation
        ↓
    PCProduct.observation_runtime

The Runtime does NOT attempt to reconstruct the
PCProduct or assign semantic meaning during acquisition.

The primary principle is:

    Reality First
    Observation First
    Semantic Later

---

# Runtime Flow

```text
PCProduct
    │
    ▼
discover_seed.py
    │
    │ Seed
    ▼
acquire_listing.py
    │
    │ HTML
    ▼
observe_listing.py
    │
    │ Observation
    ▼
observation_store.py
    │
    │ PCProduct.observation_runtime
    ▼
verify.py
    │
    ▼
DELL Runtime Complete